| `secrets.scanner.download_timeout_seconds` | integer | `60` | a whole number, 1 or more | `scripts/install_scanner.py`, through `scripts/config_loader.py`'s `secrets.scanner.download_timeout_seconds` row | Sets how many seconds `make secrets-install` waits on the release server for each read before it gives up with exit 11, naming `secrets.scanner.release_url`. Absent, the installer writes `[using default] secrets.scanner.download_timeout_seconds = 60` to stderr. | the size bound: `secrets.scanner.download_max_bytes` | always |
